---
import { SITE } from "../config";
import { url } from "../utils/url";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap footer__inner">
    <div class="footer__brand">
      <a class="brand" href={url("/")} aria-label={`${SITE.name}首页`}>
        <span class="brand__mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <Icon name="penguin" size={26} />
        </span>
        <span class="brand__text">
          <span class="brand__cn">{SITE.name}</span>
          <span class="brand__en">{SITE.nameEn}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <p class="footer__line">把它们留在互联网的一个角落。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer__meta">
      <p>非官方粉丝档案。资料与影像来自 B站公开内容，版权归原 UP 主所有。</p>
      <a
        class="footer__github"
        href={SITE.repoUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        GitHub 仓库 <Icon name="brand-github" size={16} />
      </a>
      <a class="footer__top" href="#top">
        回到顶部 <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
